# promise: #697
# A pull request merged or closed while its tab sits on one of the request's own pages (Files changed, a comment
# link, owner/repo in another case) leaves the live folder once its grace is over, as an unopened one does; before
# #697 only a tab on exactly the listed address could go, so a request you had looked at stayed for good. A tab
# gone to another page stays (Arc), and an open request stays. The folder is seeded with three requests that left
# the results days ago and one still open; Cra stays in the background, so it doesn't refresh, and the expiry pass
# (every 15 s) does the rest.
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true}
